From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:40:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: revalidate MissAV sources and resume untried
 fragments

A normal source lookup may serve the episode and master from a fresh HTTP cache entry even after a segment refusal. Revalidate both during same-quality recovery. Save which missing fragments a bounded pass has already tried and prioritize the rest after refresh or process restart. Report the retained count after both workers finish.

Keep the legacy plan hash. When only part of a playlist changes, hard-link validated fragments at the same position with identical resource, request headers and duration within this episode and quality. Never finalize with holes. Regression fixtures exercise both the disk HTTP cache and a 1,837-fragment repair. Mihon's image downloader and Animeko's independent player do not use this path.
